<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-ALGERIA BEAT BENIN 2-0.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ALGERIA BEAT BENIN 2-0.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria beat Benin 2-0 (halftime</p>
<p>2-0) in an African Nations Cup soccer match on Sunday to qualify</p>
<p>for the finals next February.</p>
<p>Scorers: Tasfaout Abdelhafid 13, Ben Zarga 27</p>
</text>
